WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.234
Toad looked up from the bench.

2
00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:06.544
"Are you all right?" said the train engineer.

3
00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:08.980
"You don't look very happy."

4
00:00:08.981 --> 00:00:12.847
"Oh, sir!" said Toad, crying.

5
00:00:12.848 --> 00:00:16.293
"I am a poor washwoman.

6
00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:19.629
I lost all my money."

7
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.101
"That's awful," said the engineer.

8
00:00:23.102 --> 00:00:27.645
"I can't pay for a ticket," cried Toad.

9
00:00:27.646 --> 00:00:30.208
"I must get home!"

10
00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:33.735
"Do you have kids?" asked the engineer.

11
00:00:33.736 --> 00:00:37.260
"Why, yes!" said Toad.

12
00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:40.483
"I have lots of kids.

13
00:00:40.484 --> 00:00:44.350
They will be crying and hungry."

14
00:00:44.351 --> 00:00:47.853
"Well, I'll help you," said the engineer.

15
00:00:47.854 --> 00:00:51.262
"You can wash my shirts to repay me."

16
00:00:51.263 --> 00:01:00.057
"I will, as soon as I get home," said Toad.

17
00:01:00.058 --> 00:01:02.527
"Hop up!" said the engineer.

18
00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.197
"You can ride on the engine with me."

19
00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.848
Toad thanked him and climbed up.

20
00:01:08.849 --> 00:01:12.522
Toad didn't know how to wash a shirt.

21
00:01:12.523 --> 00:01:16.488
He wasn't going to learn either.

22
00:01:16.489 --> 00:01:19.661
"I'll send him money," Toad thought.

23
00:01:19.662 --> 00:01:23.842
"I'll send enough to wash his shirts for a year!"

24
00:01:23.843 --> 00:01:28.225
A flagman at the station waved a flag.

25
00:01:28.226 --> 00:01:31.000
The engineer blew his whistle.

26
00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:35.942
The train sped away.

27
00:01:35.943 --> 00:01:39.900
Toad danced with delight.

28
00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:46.124
"Soon I'll be at Toad Hall!" Toad thought.

29
00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:49.562
The engineer leaned out the side.

30
00:01:49.563 --> 00:01:53.247
"I hear another train behind us!" he shouted.

31
00:01:53.248 --> 00:01:57.968
"It's chasing us, and it's coming fast!"

